# Priority policy test (FCFS vs SJF)
# Three jobs arrive close together, different durations
# Job 0: arrives at 0, runs 100 seconds, 20 nodes
20	0	100	0	batch	100
# Job 1: arrives at 5, runs 30 seconds, 20 nodes (SHORT)
20	0	0	5	batch	30
# Job 2: arrives at 10, runs 80 seconds, 20 nodes (MEDIUM)
20	0	0	10	batch	80
# Job 3: arrives at 15, runs 10 seconds, 20 nodes (VERY SHORT)
20	0	0	15	batch	10
#
# Expected with FCFS: 0 -> 1 -> 2 -> 3
# Expected with SJF: 0 -> 3 (10s) -> 1 (30s) -> 2 (80s)
